{"id":"a1888eb7039fadfa","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-lk-soundness.md","title":"有限相继式演算的语义可靠性","display":"thm-lk-soundness — 有限相继式演算的语义可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-lk-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-lk-soundness"],"display":"thm-lk-soundness — 有限相继式演算的语义可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-thm-lk-rule-soundness]]","[[72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness]]","[[72-df-sequent-validity]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3, print32–34/PDF44–46; local derivation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-lk-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-lk-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lk-soundness — 有限相继式演算的语义可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edf9ec90faf33353\" href=\"?note=edf9ec90faf33353\" title=\"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness\">72-thm-lk-rule-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73245f799abb8dc9\" href=\"?note=73245f799abb8dc9\" title=\"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness\">72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3, print32–34/PDF44–46; local derivation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"edf9ec90faf33353\" href=\"?note=edf9ec90faf33353\" title=\"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness\">72-thm-lk-rule-soundness</a> 的四种纯逻辑演算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为实际有限带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a>，没有增加非逻辑初始式或算术归纳规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\quad\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\quad\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任取结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>，逐结构规则可靠性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M))\">\\(\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M))\\)</span>。抽象证明树可靠性使根属于这个集合。最后对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 全称概括，得到有效性。论证不依赖消切终止，因而为现有消切结论提供独立的语义交叉检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-rule-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"73245f799abb8dc9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-lk-rule-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathcal C$ 取 [[72-thm-lk-rule-soundness]] 的四种纯逻辑演算；$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$ 为实际有限带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]，没有增加非逻辑初始式或算术归纳规则。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\quad\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(Q\\cap\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"7f1b713b3ea26325","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal C$ 如 [[72-thm-lk-soundness]]；$\\langle\\rangle$ 是空有限函数序列，$\\mathcal C\\vdash q$ 是有限证明存在性。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-467","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-soundness|thm-lk-soundness — 有限相继式演算的语义可靠性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-459","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-soundness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-soundness|thm-lk-soundness — 有限相继式演算的语义可靠性]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-497","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-lk-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["edf9ec90faf33353","73245f799abb8dc9","ba1b086fe1d56f25"]}